# Reference-layer intermediates, written by refscan142.py and documented in README.md as *not* part of
# the committed set: `refs/raw.json` is the pre-curation arXiv/Crossref dump (~3 MB) and is
# reproducible only with network access; every entry the pool keeps is already in `refs/pool.json`.
# `*.tmp`/`*.stage` are the atomic-write siblings an interrupted run may leave behind.
refs/raw.json
refs/*.tmp
refs/*.stage
figures/*.tmp
*.tmp
__pycache__/
.mplcache/
